  {"field_id": "6", "description": "Additional Information", "page": 1, "value": "Cavalry troop commander, OIF III. Planned and executed 500+ combat patrols with one of the highest IED detection rates in theater. Built an entrepreneurial incubator in Diyala Province while in command—economic development under fire, not just on paper.\n\nPost-combat: Led first U.S. private equity investment in post-conflict Iraq ($6M, 150 jobs created). Advised Afghanistan Ministry of Public Health at ministerial level. Serial entrepreneur—raised $6M+ across ventures, $30M aggregate portfolio value.\n\nTechnical depth in blockchain, AI/ML, and OSINT. Coordinated JSOC threat finance crypto targeting pilot. Currently building AI C2 systems for defense. Best employed where Commerce & Trade meets technical complexity: threat finance, illicit crypto networks, defense tech diligence.\n\nMIL: wayne.culbreth.mil@army.mil\nCIV: wayne.culbreth@gmail.com"},
